# Cells the KLayout standard-cell LVS deck (sky130_stdcell.lvs) cannot pair with
# their CDL subcircuit, kept out of synthesis, sizing and CTS so every design's
# LVS stays meaningful (found by signoff; checked by hand).
#
# a21oi_2: the layout draws the A1/A2 pull-down as two series chains with their
# own inner nodes; the CDL writes one chain with m=2. The engine merges parallel
# devices but not parallel series chains (2026-10-15, gcd at 1.1 ns).
sky130_fd_sc_hd__a21oi_2
